{% blurb = capture do %}
Critics expressed early concern that DOGE's involvement with the Department of Labor was motivated by Elon's desire to shut down unionizing and identify whistleblowers at his companies. However, it seems like DOGE's main intersts at DOL have been several databases that track information about immigrants within the US. DOL has also been a handy staging base to deploy wreckers Marko Elez and Aram Mohgaddassi into the field at other agencies.{% end %}

